# systemd-sysusers(8) fragment: creates the service account.
# Installed to /usr/lib/sysusers.d/ by `make install`, applied by
# `systemd-sysusers` (or automatically at boot).
#
# A static user rather than DynamicUser=, deliberately: the snapshots in
# /var/lib/ntrip-monitor exist to be read by another party (the Munin
# plugin, running as the munin user), and DynamicUser= relocates the
# state directory under /var/lib/private, which is root-only.  A monitor
# whose output nobody can read is not monitoring anything.
u ntrip-monitor - "NTRIP stream monitor"
